      <MissionDesc>TO FOSTER A CULTURE OF INNOVATION AND COLLABORATION AMONG NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS THROUGH TECHNOLOGY, WITH A FOCUS ON BALBOA PARK. BPOC'S VISION IS TO BE A TECHNOLOGY COLLABORATION THAT CONNECTS AUDIENCES TO ART, CULTURE, AND SCIENCE.</MissionDesc>
      <SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>0</SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>
      <SignificantChangeInd>0</SignificantChangeInd>
      <ExpenseAmt>401145</ExpenseAmt>
      <Desc>BPOC CORE SUPPORT PROVIDES COMPETITIVE AND AFFORDABLE IT CONTRACT SERVICES TO 28 CULTURAL INSTITUTIONS IN BALBOA PARK ALLOWING THE ORGANIZATIONS TO ACCOMPLISH HIGH LEVELS OF TECHNOLOGICAL PROFICIENCY AND COLLABORATIVE SERVICES INCLUDING THE PARK-WIDE DATA AND A SHARED PHONE SYSTEM. BPOC'S PERVASIVE WIRELESS NETWORK IS NOW PROVIDING SHARED INTERNET ACCESS TO 23 BALBOA PARK CULTURAL INSTITUTIONS AS WELL AS TO THE PUBLIC VIA 200 PUBLIC WIRELESS ACCESS POINTS AND HOTSPOTS DEPLOYED BY BPOC. THIS INVESTMENT IN THE WIFI INFRASTRUCTURE IMPROVES THE OVERALL VISITOR EXPERIENCE, SERVING AN AVERAGE OF 3700 CLIENTS PER DAY AND ENABLING PARK INSTITUTIONS TO UTILIZE TECHNOLOGIES THAT ENGAGE AND BROADEN THEIR AUDIENCES. BPOC ALSO PROVIDES COMPETITIVE AND AFFORDABLE IT CONTRACT SERVICES TO 3 CULTURAL ORGANIZATIONS OUTSIDE BALBOA PARK.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>177660</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>SEE SCHEDULE O</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>61463</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>BPOC USES A MULTI-PLATFORM DIGITAL MARKETING STRATEGY, TO INFORM AND ENGAGE MORE THAN 12 MILLION PEOPLE WHO VISIT BALBOA PARK EACH YEAR, BPOC COORDINATES WITH MANY BALBOA PARK PARTNERS, INCLUDING BALBOA PARK CULTURAL PARTNERSHIP AND FOREVER BALBOA PARK, TO IMPLEMENT A MULTI-PLATFORM DIGITAL STRATEGY THAT INCLUDES BALBOAPARK.ORG, A CONTENT-RICH HUB FOR EVERYTHING AND ANYTHING FOR THE BALBOA PARK VISITOR. THE RESPONSIVE WEBSITE FEATURES A PARK-WIDE CALENDAR MODULE AND PREFERENCE-BASED, CURATED ITINERARIES THAT OFFER UNUSUAL WAYS TO EXPERIENCE BALBOA PARK. BALBOAPARK.ORG ATTRACTS APPROXIMATELY 1.5 MILLION VISITORS PER YEAR AND ITS SOCIAL MEDIA PAGES ENGAGE OVER ONE MILLION FOLLOWERS.</Desc>
